WEBVTT

00:03.560 --> 00:05.930
"Music Club Joint Recital"
Alright, let's take five.

00:07.960 --> 00:09.820
How was the start?

00:09.820 --> 00:11.490
It was good.

00:11.490 --> 00:13.030
Come to think of it.

00:13.380 --> 00:15.780
Does our band have a name?

00:16.460 --> 00:20.060
We're gonna have our big debut
at the school recital and all.

00:20.060 --> 00:21.690
Shouldn't we have one?

00:21.690 --> 00:23.120
A band name...

00:23.120 --> 00:26.580
What we need is for you
to practice. The clock's ticking.

00:26.580 --> 00:28.620
Omusubi, stop. Or stop, Omusubi.

00:28.930 --> 00:30.280
Excuse me, what?

00:30.280 --> 00:31.560
What do you say, Airi?

00:31.560 --> 00:37.880
Hmm, there's no need for one since
we'll be introduced as the a cappella club.

00:37.880 --> 00:39.560
Aw, really?

00:39.560 --> 00:40.720
That said.

00:41.330 --> 00:44.470
We'll need one if we ever
perform outside of school.

00:44.920 --> 00:47.060
Then why don't we come up with a name now?

00:47.380 --> 00:49.520
Now? Can't we do this when the time comes?

00:49.520 --> 00:50.810
Let's do it now.

00:50.810 --> 00:51.570
Yeah, let's.

00:51.570 --> 00:52.310
Hey.

00:52.310 --> 00:53.570
"A Cappella Club Band Name Meeting"

00:53.570 --> 00:55.170
Rock, paper...

00:55.170 --> 00:55.850
Scissors!

01:00.060 --> 01:02.280
Alright, U–tan goes first.

01:03.810 --> 01:07.610
A high school band name will
haunt you for the rest of your life.

01:07.610 --> 01:09.950
I'll have to live with this cringe...

01:09.950 --> 01:12.990
What's life without
a youthful indiscretion or two?

01:12.990 --> 01:15.460
Neither of you sound like teens right now.

01:15.460 --> 01:17.750
Let's just agree on one
and get this over with.

01:17.750 --> 01:19.420
Don't raise the bar any higher!

01:21.460 --> 01:22.170
Here...

01:26.610 --> 01:27.620
Uta–chan.

01:27.620 --> 01:30.000
I really like it.

01:31.630 --> 01:36.470
"Hands Together"

02:07.740 --> 02:09.710
Thanks for coming.

02:10.500 --> 02:12.300
You did great.

02:12.300 --> 02:14.110
How was the performance?

02:14.110 --> 02:15.960
It was... amazing.

02:16.270 --> 02:21.050
Parabola has a better bass–baritone
range with you in their lineup.

02:21.050 --> 02:22.010
Thanks.

02:22.010 --> 02:26.300
So, are you officially joining Parabola
instead of being like, a guest singer?

02:26.730 --> 02:28.430
Yup, that's my plan.

02:28.900 --> 02:30.470
They've been scouting me for some time.

02:30.990 --> 02:33.440
Sorry for springing this on you.

02:33.890 --> 02:35.820
I'm a coward.

02:35.820 --> 02:40.190
I never thought of challenging
my abilities in higher level stages.

02:40.850 --> 02:44.490
That I'm taking the plunge now
is all thanks to you girls.

02:45.410 --> 02:47.900
I've been on the fence the whole time,

02:47.900 --> 02:50.870
but now I want to give a cappella
everything I've got.

02:50.870 --> 02:53.880
I approve of your decision.
I wish you all the best.

02:54.310 --> 02:55.470
Musubu...

02:55.470 --> 02:56.500
Um...

02:56.800 --> 02:59.540
Are you quitting the club?

03:02.610 --> 03:04.330
I'm still considering it.

03:04.760 --> 03:09.090
I'll have to spend my time with
Parabola if I want to make this work.

03:12.860 --> 03:13.800
Airi?

03:17.170 --> 03:18.820
Wow, talk about a surprise!

03:18.820 --> 03:19.430
Airi?

03:19.430 --> 03:21.020
Hello, long time no see.

03:22.920 --> 03:24.320
Whoa there.

03:26.180 --> 03:28.730
You've become prettier
since we last met, Airi.

03:29.150 --> 03:31.030
Why would you do this?

03:31.580 --> 03:32.610
Is this about Rei?

03:33.070 --> 03:34.780
Who else?

03:34.780 --> 03:38.610
The answer's simple. Our interests aligned.

03:38.610 --> 03:42.830
Rei wants to join Parabola,
and I want her to.

03:42.830 --> 03:46.490
We were having a great time as a club.

03:46.490 --> 03:49.830
I know. That's good,
you should keep doing that.

03:50.820 --> 03:52.540
Why did it have to be Reirei?

03:53.560 --> 03:57.440
Rei's necessary for us
to achieve our dream.

03:57.440 --> 03:59.420
She has the looks and personality.

03:59.420 --> 04:04.010
Above all, she has a bass–baritone range,
a rarity with female a cappella singers.

04:04.370 --> 04:07.790
Not to mention the level
she's at for her age.

04:07.790 --> 04:11.450
Rei Konoe was undoubtedly
born to sing a cappella.

04:11.450 --> 04:15.600
It seems she's been hiding her talons,
pretending to be like the others.

04:15.890 --> 04:18.020
Surely you noticed that?

04:19.450 --> 04:20.690
So what if I have?

04:21.260 --> 04:24.460
That someone as eloquent as you
is struggling to say anything

04:24.460 --> 04:28.050
means you thought Rei brought
a lot to our performance.

04:28.050 --> 04:31.450
Your heart tells you that Rei
probably does belong with us.

04:31.910 --> 04:32.950
That's not...

04:33.220 --> 04:37.780
I saw this possibility ever since you
came to us as middle schoolers,

04:37.780 --> 04:40.040
asking us to teach you a cappella.

04:40.040 --> 04:44.790
Though, at the time
I imagined you'd also join us.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.900
It's not too late, you know?

04:46.900 --> 04:49.800
Why don't we revolutionize
the country's music scene together?

04:50.230 --> 04:53.680
I'm not chasing that pipe dream of yours.

04:53.680 --> 04:55.090
If you say so.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.680
You can't make it in this industry
if you're not willing to.

04:58.090 --> 04:59.660
Listen here, Airi.

04:59.660 --> 05:04.310
I understand what you must be feeling,
and Mizuki honestly sucks as a person.

05:04.760 --> 05:08.650
But it's not like we forced Konoe
to join us kicking and screaming.

05:08.650 --> 05:12.780
That's right. We have every intention
to support her now that she's one of us.

05:16.760 --> 05:19.070
None of us are kids here.

05:19.070 --> 05:22.830
Konoe decided this for herself.
Why don't you talk things out with her?

05:24.450 --> 05:28.580
All I wanted...
was for things to stay the same...

05:30.460 --> 05:32.990
Wanting things to stay the same?

05:32.990 --> 05:36.420
Now that's a pipe dream
if I ever heard of one.

05:43.610 --> 05:44.680
Airi!

05:48.260 --> 05:49.560
Ow.

05:49.560 --> 05:51.040
You went too far.

05:52.710 --> 05:53.670
Airi!

06:13.950 --> 06:15.850
What was that for?

06:15.850 --> 06:19.460
Let's have dinner!
I don't wanna split with things this way!

06:20.620 --> 06:24.500
There's nothing we can do about
what Reirei–senpai decided on.

06:24.500 --> 06:28.010
Okay, but how are we supposed to take this?

06:28.420 --> 06:33.060
Too many things happened
for me to fully process.

06:33.060 --> 06:34.470
I know, right?

06:34.830 --> 06:37.720
To be honest... I was shocked.

06:37.720 --> 06:40.980
I never knew that she was
hiding her potential,

06:41.310 --> 06:43.460
and that she was actually a bassist.

06:44.340 --> 06:50.070
I can't help but wonder... how she must've
felt whenever she praised my bass.

06:50.070 --> 06:52.900
I can only imagine.

06:52.900 --> 06:56.300
Kinda makes you think she's been
taking the piss at you, except...

06:57.130 --> 06:57.910
Except?

06:58.740 --> 07:02.510
I feel awful knowing
she did it because of us.

07:03.080 --> 07:05.030
Yeah, I feel the same way.

07:06.530 --> 07:10.960
If you ask me, she should be putting
her skills to use on the right stage.

07:10.960 --> 07:12.540
Moreso if that's what she wants.

07:12.860 --> 07:16.700
Couldn't she have waited
until after high school?

07:18.150 --> 07:19.850
Your thoughts, U–tan?

07:19.850 --> 07:21.620
I feel the same way.

07:21.620 --> 07:22.300
About what?

07:22.900 --> 07:26.670
I don't want Reirei–senpai
to quit the club,

07:26.670 --> 07:29.520
yet I want to support
whatever she decides on.

07:30.060 --> 07:34.230
I want her to stay,
but I also wish her the best.

07:34.660 --> 07:37.970
Maybe there's no need to take one side?

07:37.970 --> 07:40.070
Not when I honestly feel both ways.

07:40.360 --> 07:42.280
You're so mature now...

07:42.280 --> 07:47.000
Besides, if it's our singing
that changed Reirei–senpai,

07:47.000 --> 07:49.400
then it's an incredible feat
by the a cappella club.

07:49.400 --> 07:51.460
That's true...

07:51.460 --> 07:55.850
Yeah. I don't know how much
longer she'll be in the club

07:55.850 --> 07:57.870
but I want her to have fond memories of us.

07:58.200 --> 07:59.520
Omusubi?

07:59.520 --> 08:01.090
I'm in the same boat as her.

08:01.090 --> 08:03.130
Once she looks back as she tries to go pro,

08:03.130 --> 08:08.170
I'm sure the good memories of her
club days will motivate her further.

08:08.930 --> 08:10.210
What?

08:10.210 --> 08:11.730
Booyah!

08:11.730 --> 08:12.560
Cut that out!

08:12.560 --> 08:14.400
Way to go, Omusubi!

08:14.400 --> 08:16.730
–You cutie, you!
–Musubu–chan's right.

08:16.730 --> 08:17.560
That just leaves...

08:17.560 --> 08:19.720
Airi–senpai, right?

08:20.090 --> 08:22.890
Yup. We can't leave things like this.

08:23.200 --> 08:25.770
What can we do, though?

08:29.670 --> 08:32.070
Damn, this is a tough one...

08:36.730 --> 08:37.700
What's up?

08:38.210 --> 08:40.280
Check this out.

08:40.280 --> 08:41.120
What is it?

08:42.060 --> 08:44.580
This might do the trick.

08:48.110 --> 08:49.710
Airi–san!

08:49.710 --> 08:51.930
We've been looking all over for you!

08:51.930 --> 08:53.250
Huh? What's going on?

08:53.860 --> 08:56.920
Please read the email Ururu–chan received!

08:57.560 --> 09:01.340
Performance invitation for
Temarizawa High's a cappella club...

09:01.790 --> 09:05.980
From the Temarizawa Christmas
Social Event Committee...

09:05.980 --> 09:06.800
Uh...

09:07.200 --> 09:10.810
It's a local Christmas event
at the community hall.

09:10.810 --> 09:12.810
They're asking us to perform there.

09:12.810 --> 09:15.310
Why did they reach out to Ururu–chan?

09:15.310 --> 09:18.060
They contacted me through my MeTube.

09:18.060 --> 09:21.820
I'm guessing they saw the videos
of our street performances.

09:22.350 --> 09:24.950
We should be in this. All six of us!

09:25.910 --> 09:27.380
Six...

09:28.680 --> 09:32.400
Sure, if that's what you want.

09:32.400 --> 09:34.460
I'll reply to them.

09:34.460 --> 09:37.680
No, you can leave it to us.

09:37.680 --> 09:38.500
Huh?

09:38.500 --> 09:42.750
There's something else
we'd like you to do instead.

09:44.500 --> 09:46.840
We want you to write us an original song!

09:48.340 --> 09:53.570
We'd love to sing a song written
and composed by you!

09:53.570 --> 09:54.970
Please!

09:55.670 --> 09:56.930
Oh... uh?

09:58.130 --> 09:59.100
What?

10:12.230 --> 10:13.240
President.

10:16.750 --> 10:18.130
Musubu–chan.

10:18.130 --> 10:20.600
Any progress with the lyrics?

10:20.990 --> 10:22.970
Not at all.

10:23.510 --> 10:26.320
Sorry. I know we're short on time.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.960
Don't be. We asked you to do this.

10:30.300 --> 10:33.920
I usually have no problems writing songs.
Not sure why I'm struggling.

10:34.380 --> 10:36.920
I hope you'll write down
what you honestly feel.

10:38.230 --> 10:42.890
That's tough. I've never been
honest with my feelings.

10:43.310 --> 10:47.150
I grew up as a kid who
never complained in her life.

10:47.150 --> 10:49.130
I don't know how to voice my thoughts.

10:49.130 --> 10:50.910
Isn't that more reason why you should?

10:50.910 --> 10:51.680
Huh?

10:51.680 --> 10:54.300
You're allowed to express
yourself through music.

10:54.710 --> 10:56.110
That's what I mean.

10:57.370 --> 11:02.300
Everything you want to say,
including what you normally can't.

11:02.300 --> 11:03.860
Is that how it is?

11:04.180 --> 11:09.240
Yup. It's a musician's privilege to say
"I love you" with a straight face.

11:11.950 --> 11:13.910
"Multicolored harmony"

11:16.830 --> 11:17.920
Senpai.

11:18.770 --> 11:21.040
How is it like being in Parabola?

11:21.880 --> 11:23.650
Seems like you're doing good.

11:23.650 --> 11:25.920
That last video raked in huge views.

11:26.280 --> 11:29.980
Ah, yeah. They really are amazing.

11:29.980 --> 11:32.010
I'm barely keeping up with them.

11:32.790 --> 11:33.970
Um...

11:34.440 --> 11:37.470
Have you made up your mind about the club?

11:38.170 --> 11:39.350
I still can't decide.

11:42.430 --> 11:45.690
Oh, but I'll be there for our
Christmas performance.

11:46.050 --> 11:49.310
They approached us after seeing us sing.

11:49.310 --> 11:50.770
We have to give them a good show.

11:50.770 --> 11:52.300
For sure.

11:52.300 --> 11:58.200
That means this Christmas might be
the last time we sing together.

12:01.730 --> 12:02.410
Uta.

12:03.180 --> 12:04.040
Musubu–chan.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.300
The ball's in your court now.

12:15.210 --> 12:16.710
Um...

12:17.100 --> 12:19.090
What's up, Uta–chan?

12:19.460 --> 12:23.930
Mu–Musubu–chan said
it's up to me to help you.

12:25.690 --> 12:27.180
That's very assuring.

12:28.810 --> 12:29.940
What was that about?

12:30.660 --> 12:32.850
The president needs help with the lyrics.

12:33.120 --> 12:36.380
Ah... that's good. I get it.

12:36.380 --> 12:38.980
Uta's a good listener to confide in.

12:39.640 --> 12:42.560
You sure are chill about this, Rei–san.

12:42.990 --> 12:47.610
I figured you'd be bothered
by how down Airi–san is.

12:48.110 --> 12:48.990
Oh.

12:48.990 --> 12:52.360
I'm worried about how
things are between you two.

12:52.360 --> 12:54.240
You don't seem to have talked it out.

12:55.020 --> 12:57.330
Sorry for worrying you.

12:57.940 --> 12:58.750
Here.

12:58.750 --> 13:00.450
Thank you.

13:00.450 --> 13:02.040
It sure is cold up here.

13:02.040 --> 13:02.630
Yeah...

13:04.110 --> 13:07.800
I want what we currently
have to last forever.

13:08.170 --> 13:10.210
Forever?

13:10.210 --> 13:12.510
Yup... I wish time would stand still.

13:12.800 --> 13:14.050
Uh...

13:14.050 --> 13:15.650
I know, it's impossible.

13:15.650 --> 13:19.720
Which is why I want things
to end as they are.

13:20.430 --> 13:22.730
I'm uncertain about the future.

13:23.190 --> 13:27.740
Only when I harmonize with others
through a cappella do I feel assured.

13:28.180 --> 13:32.530
I know they're hearing me sing,
matching their voice to mine.

13:32.530 --> 13:35.950
That's how I feel we're connected,
and it brings me relief.

13:36.970 --> 13:41.540
I started the club because
I sought a relationship unique to me.

13:41.540 --> 13:43.950
Reirei and I founded the a cappella club,

13:43.950 --> 13:47.760
then you and the others
joined in our second year...

13:48.280 --> 13:50.490
It became a very special place to me.

13:51.180 --> 13:53.310
Every day was full of fun.

13:53.680 --> 13:56.750
So much that I couldn't stand losing it.

13:57.970 --> 13:58.870
And yet...

13:59.540 --> 14:02.960
Everyone's changing and moving forward.

14:03.320 --> 14:05.390
I know that's just how it is.

14:08.680 --> 14:12.440
You're the same.
You're not the same as when we met.

14:12.870 --> 14:13.980
You're stronger now.

14:14.900 --> 14:18.080
Please, don't leave me.

14:20.460 --> 14:24.740
I'm, uh, sorry... that I changed.

14:24.740 --> 14:26.530
At least I think I have...

14:26.920 --> 14:27.820
Yeah.

14:27.820 --> 14:29.490
And I'll continue to.

14:30.200 --> 14:33.060
One day, I'll finish high school.

14:33.500 --> 14:38.000
It's possible I won't sing a cappella
anymore as an adult...

14:38.790 --> 14:41.040
That'll be sad...

14:41.820 --> 14:44.090
No, it's not.

14:44.610 --> 14:46.450
Airi and I will be fine.

14:46.450 --> 14:47.920
You sure?

14:47.920 --> 14:53.010
I trust her. Things are a little rocky
because we never disagreed before.

14:53.010 --> 14:56.570
That's why I keep saying
you're too soft on her.

14:56.570 --> 14:59.520
You wouldn't be in this mess if you
had put your foot down more.

14:59.820 --> 15:01.340
I suppose so.

15:01.340 --> 15:03.190
It'll work out, though.

15:03.190 --> 15:05.230
This isn't enough to end our bond.

15:05.930 --> 15:07.730
Not after everything we've been through.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.230
No!

15:11.280 --> 15:13.100
Y–You have to talk things out!

15:13.100 --> 15:15.160
S–So you won't have any regrets!

15:15.160 --> 15:16.070
Kuma–chan...

15:16.070 --> 15:19.200
Y–You have to express
yourselves through words!

15:19.200 --> 15:21.800
Don't hold yourself back like an adult!

15:21.800 --> 15:24.160
P–Pretending to be
mature won't solve things!

15:24.160 --> 15:27.440
W–We're still kids!

15:27.440 --> 15:29.710
What's wrong with making mistakes?!

15:30.350 --> 15:32.170
So what if you hurt each other?

15:32.630 --> 15:34.630
You just have to apologize then!

15:37.470 --> 15:40.980
I like the person I've changed into.

15:40.980 --> 15:43.470
I like that I took up a cappella.

15:45.000 --> 15:47.040
It was you who changed me.

15:47.040 --> 15:50.060
The club you started was what changed me.

15:50.820 --> 15:54.620
That's why I'm grateful
to you and a cappella.

15:55.490 --> 15:57.690
Change is scary.

15:57.690 --> 15:59.330
It makes my heart race.

15:59.330 --> 16:02.690
But that's also a sign I'll meet a new me.

16:03.040 --> 16:06.830
It makes me feel I can let myself
be swept by the change.

16:06.830 --> 16:09.620
Uh, what I mean is...

16:09.620 --> 16:13.690
I've come to love the person
you changed me into...

16:13.690 --> 16:16.370
I want you to feel the same way...

16:16.370 --> 16:18.500
So, um...

16:18.900 --> 16:21.970
I want to change together with you.

16:21.970 --> 16:23.070
With me?

16:23.070 --> 16:23.790
Yes.

16:24.530 --> 16:27.720
Like, we can still meet up
when we're grannies.

16:28.420 --> 16:29.380
Grannies?

16:29.740 --> 16:35.450
Yeah. Though, we'll probably
look and think different then.

16:35.450 --> 16:37.390
You never know what life will bring.

16:37.740 --> 16:41.600
Anyway, we'll laugh about
how much we changed.

16:41.600 --> 16:44.340
We may be senior and junior now,

16:44.340 --> 16:47.480
but once we're old being a year
apart won't matter anymore.

16:47.480 --> 16:50.510
Who knows, we could be
closer friends than we are now.

16:50.510 --> 16:53.240
We'll talk about our club days
whenever we catch up.

16:53.950 --> 17:00.890
Our fights, our setbacks,
the things we won or didn't win...

17:00.890 --> 17:02.200
All of it's precious.

17:02.200 --> 17:04.570
We enjoyed our adolescence.

17:07.160 --> 17:10.000
I think that would be wonderful.

17:15.550 --> 17:16.670
I am...

17:17.240 --> 17:19.270
sort of looking forward to it.

17:21.180 --> 17:22.510
Airi!

17:22.850 --> 17:23.940
Reirei...

17:26.800 --> 17:31.230
I'm sorry that I've been
keeping how I felt to myself...

17:32.070 --> 17:36.350
I thought you were the one person
who'd always be with me.

17:36.830 --> 17:38.650
That's who I intended to be.

17:38.650 --> 17:41.610
I was happy with keeping it that way...

17:41.610 --> 17:44.690
I never knew that I forced
you to hide your talent.

17:44.690 --> 17:48.700
Sorry. I did it so I could be with you.

17:50.350 --> 17:52.080
I'll do my best with Parabola.

17:54.050 --> 17:57.870
I've come to love a cappella
after you got me into it.

17:59.390 --> 18:02.050
I'll show you all my efforts.

18:02.050 --> 18:04.540
So please, don't be
afraid of moving forward.

18:20.640 --> 18:23.600
"Christmas Event"

18:26.590 --> 18:30.490
This was not what I expected.

18:30.490 --> 18:34.070
Didn't they call this a concert
when they invited us?

18:34.070 --> 18:37.820
They sure did.
My adorable li'l sister asked.

18:38.210 --> 18:40.370
You knew about this, Kikka.

18:40.370 --> 18:42.610
You wouldn't be here if I told you.

18:42.610 --> 18:45.140
We turned down so many offers to be here.

18:45.140 --> 18:49.310
Come on, it's the least we could
do after what we did to them.

18:59.420 --> 19:01.560
Hello, everyone.

19:01.560 --> 19:05.800
We're part of Temarizawa
High School's a cappella club.

19:06.290 --> 19:10.680
Thank you for having us
at your big Christmas event.

19:10.980 --> 19:12.890
Um, we'll sing as best as we can.

19:13.300 --> 19:13.940
Okay...

19:13.940 --> 19:14.860
U–tan!

19:15.630 --> 19:17.940
You forgot to say the thing!

19:18.210 --> 19:19.190
Oh.

19:19.800 --> 19:21.650
Our band has a name!

19:21.730 --> 19:24.150
"Tetote"

19:24.750 --> 19:27.080
We're called Tetote!

19:27.930 --> 19:29.240
As in "hands together?"

19:31.970 --> 19:36.910
We chose this name to feel like our hands
are joined with yours when we sing.

19:37.300 --> 19:41.460
We're a simple school club
that isn't bound for greatness!

19:41.460 --> 19:46.920
Even so, we want to make this a day
that gives hope for the future!

22:11.220 --> 22:12.880
Isn't this a great sight?

22:14.520 --> 22:17.300
Your desire to turn a cappella
into a major genre.

22:17.300 --> 22:22.260
Isn't this what you're trying to achieve
by making a cappella a national sensation?

22:23.310 --> 22:24.970
I suppose so.

22:27.300 --> 22:29.930
It's because I love a cappella.

22:30.890 --> 22:32.030
Ouch.

22:32.030 --> 22:34.090
You can stay that way.

22:34.090 --> 22:35.280
That's right.

22:35.280 --> 22:36.770
Aren't you taking us to the top?

22:39.390 --> 22:40.190
Um...

22:40.790 --> 22:43.430
Thank you for coming to watch us.

22:43.430 --> 22:45.150
S–Sorry.

22:45.530 --> 22:48.340
For being arrogant enough
to call you here, I mean.

22:49.490 --> 22:52.120
Don't be. Your performance was fantastic.

22:52.420 --> 22:54.490
Th–Thank you!

22:55.940 --> 22:58.500
Airi, this a cappella club of yours

22:58.840 --> 23:00.110
isn't bad at all.

23:02.410 --> 23:04.710
Yes. I'm very proud of it.

23:06.940 --> 23:08.450
Oh right, Rei.

23:08.450 --> 23:09.420
Yes?

23:09.420 --> 23:11.460
Can you handle both
Parabola and your club?

23:11.460 --> 23:12.130
Eh?

23:12.600 --> 23:14.060
Give it a shot.

23:14.085 --> 23:16.875
It won't be easy,
but I'm sure you'll manage.

23:20.370 --> 23:22.600
Yes! I'll do my best with both!

23:22.990 --> 23:25.850
Do you ladies sing a cappella, too?

23:26.220 --> 23:30.230
Yup. They're extremely good at it.

23:30.710 --> 23:31.970
I wanna hear them!

23:31.970 --> 23:34.950
Hold on, we're not singing here.

23:38.830 --> 23:39.820
Wow!

23:41.620 --> 23:43.930
Oh, fine.

23:45.540 --> 23:47.270
Let's do this!

23:50.790 --> 23:52.750
"Club Member Registration"

24:09.130 --> 24:11.360
U–Um, I...

24:13.350 --> 24:15.730
Just so you know...

24:16.120 --> 24:17.920
A cappella's pretty obscure,

24:17.920 --> 24:20.460
people stare at you when you practice,

24:20.460 --> 24:23.150
and our members are... peculiar.

24:23.150 --> 24:26.610
We have a blonde here,
plus Musubu–chan's scary.

24:26.610 --> 24:27.490
You calling me out?

24:28.370 --> 24:33.000
Despite everything, I believe you'll
cherish the time you spend here, so...

24:33.890 --> 24:37.210
Would you like to sing a cappella with us?
